{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>BURN THE WITCH</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear Calamity is a top-down psychological and survival horror, you're stuck on a shifting labyrinth with a <strong>relentless immortal monster</strong>, while managing your <i>light levels, hunger, exhaustion</i> trying not to lead the creature directly to you with your blood and sounds...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/a61af0925c16dea977a67a4eda3e5c0b.poster.avif?t=1769019146\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/a61af0925c16dea977a67a4eda3e5c0b.webm?t=1769019146\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/a61af0925c16dea977a67a4eda3e5c0b.mp4?t=1769019146\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond managing your backpack, <u><i>every bad thing that happens to you also get rid of precious space on what you may hold.</i></u><br>Be careful on what your eyes may see, as your own <strong>paranoia</strong> and <strong>stress</strong> increase to the brink of a <strong>heart attack</strong>.<br>Between each level, moments of strange events may unfold, your actions have consequences on the twisting corridors, even when you're not being observed... or when you <i>think</i> you're not being observed...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/175df3e7697d17e6ca81351a13376953.poster.avif?t=1769019146\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2874220/extras/175df3e7697d17e6ca8